<!-- ===== 1. OVERVIEW ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap split split--top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="Ringkasan">The brief</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Takaful ialah kategori yang orang suka tangguhkan.">Takaful is a category people like to postpone.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Perlindungan kewangan dan kesihatan bukan topik yang orang cari sendiri. PruBSN memerlukan format yang membuatkan orang berhenti menatal &mdash; sesuatu yang boleh dikongsi oleh barisan ejen mereka dan difahami oleh orang awam dalam bahasa harian.">Financial and health protection are not subjects people go looking for. PruBSN needed a format that makes people stop scrolling &mdash; something their agency force could share and the public could follow in everyday language.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Terdapat empat keperluan berasingan di atas meja: format perbualan bulanan, suapan sosial berterusan untuk komuniti PruBSN Stars, dua acara agensi utama, dan filem kempen untuk pengaktifan ejen serta Health360. Empat keperluan biasanya bermakna empat vendor &mdash; dan empat rupa yang berbeza.">There were four separate needs on the table: a monthly talk format, an ongoing social feed for the PruBSN Stars community, two flagship agency events, and campaign films for agent activation and Health360. Four needs usually means four vendors &mdash; and four different looks.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Kami mengambil kesemuanya sebagai satu bidang kerja: satu arah kreatif, satu pasukan produksi, satu standard penyerahan.">We took all four as one body of work: one creative direction, one production team, one delivery standard.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Kewangan &amp; Takaful">Finance &amp; Takaful</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Kuala Lumpur">Kuala Lumpur</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost">2024&ndash;2025</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media split__media--wide reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/prubsn-social-2.jpg" alt="Content being filmed for the PruBSN Stars social media channels" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:4rem">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Apa yang kami serahkan">What we delivered</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Empat aliran kerja, satu sistem.">Four workstreams, one system.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="step-list step-list--2">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Podcast langsung Jom Borak">Jom Borak live podcast</h3>
        <p data-bm="Produksi podcast langsung bulanan &mdash; termasuk edisi Kewangan dan edisi Kesihatan Jantung &mdash; dari susun atur set hingga potongan sosial selepas siaran.">Monthly live podcast production &mdash; including the Financial edition and the Heart Health edition &mdash; from set layout through to post-broadcast social cutdowns.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Media sosial PruBSN Stars">PruBSN Stars social media</h3>
        <p data-bm="Pengurusan digital dan media sosial berterusan merentasi Instagram, Facebook dan TikTok: perancangan berstruktur, kesedaran tren, penjejakan prestasi dan pelaporan.">Ongoing digital and social media management across Instagram, Facebook and TikTok: structured planning, trend awareness, performance tracking and reporting.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Acara korporat">Corporate events</h3>
        <p data-bm="MDRT Buddies 2025 dan YEBEL 2025 &mdash; produksi dan liputan acara agensi penuh, daripada pentas dan dewan besar hingga reel sorotan.">MDRT Buddies 2025 and YEBEL 2025 &mdash; full agency event production and coverage, from stage and ballroom floor to the highlight reels.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Video korporat &amp; kesedaran">Corporate &amp; awareness video</h3>
        <p data-bm="Filem kempen pengaktifan ejen untuk rangkaian dalaman, dan filem kesedaran Health360 untuk khalayak awam.">The agent activation campaign film for the internal network, and the Health360 awareness film for the public-facing audience.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

