      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="04 &middot; Video korporat &amp; kesedaran">04 &middot; Corporate &amp; awareness video</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Dua khalayak, dua filem.">Two audiences, two films.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Kempen pengaktifan ejen bercakap ke dalam: ia perlu menjelaskan program dengan jelas kepada rangkaian ejen dan membuat mereka mahu menyertainya. Kejelasan mengalahkan gaya di sini &mdash; struktur, sari kata dan tempo dibina supaya mesej mendarat pada tontonan pertama.">The agent activation campaign speaks inward: it has to explain the programme clearly to the agency network and make them want in. Clarity beats style here &mdash; structure, subtitles and pacing are built so the message lands on the first watch.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Health360 bercakap ke luar. Filem kesedaran kesihatan mesti diterima oleh orang yang tidak memikirkan takaful langsung, jadi ia bermula daripada kehidupan harian dan bukan daripada produk.">Health360 speaks outward. A health awareness film has to be accepted by people who are not thinking about takaful at all, so it starts from everyday life rather than from the product.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Kedua-duanya diserahkan dengan potongan penuh, versi pendek, dan format menegak untuk media sosial.">Both were delivered as a full cut, a short version, and vertical formats for social.</p>
